VALUES ('doc-14-nist-sp-800-53-p193-15', 'doc-14-nist-sp-800-53', '', 193, 'Discussion: Failure to protect nonlocal maintenance and diagnostic communications can result in unauthorized individuals gaining access to organizational information. Unauthorized', 'kb-doc-14-nist-sp-800-53-p193-15', 0, 20, '14-nist-sp-800-53', 'retrieved', 'F495E7F0EEDB062CE6C9D2049C2BFEF7469F95B9A057FB2DF685DC685B5E39C0', 'v1', '{"source_id": "14-nist-sp-800-53", "version": "retrieved", "corpus_version": "v1", "knowledge_object_type": "REFERENCE_CONCEPT"}')
