VALUES ('doc-14-nist-sp-800-53-p201-2', 'doc-14-nist-sp-800-53', '', 201, 'mechanisms can provide confidentiality and integrity protections depending on the mechanisms implemented. Activities associated with media transport include releasing media for transport, ensuring that media enters the appropriate transport processes, and the actual transport.', 'kb-doc-14-nist-sp-800-53-p201-2', 0, 34, '14-nist-sp-800-53', 'retrieved', 'EC4E44BD55CA593785E7057A42742D57CB6F8A867B486D032028AEB99326E11E', 'v1', '{"source_id": "14-nist-sp-800-53", "version": "retrieved", "corpus_version": "v1", "knowledge_object_type": "REFERENCE_CONCEPT"}')
