VALUES ('doc-14-nist-sp-800-53-p217-17', 'doc-14-nist-sp-800-53', '', 217, 'Discussion: Enforcing authorizations for entry and exit of system components may require restricting access to delivery areas and isolating the areas from the system and media libraries.', 'kb-doc-14-nist-sp-800-53-p217-17', 0, 27, '14-nist-sp-800-53', 'retrieved', '3D2A903FBE7236B3E39325407A0EAA32AFD04A504EF40A553869CDAE7C447401', 'v1', '{"source_id": "14-nist-sp-800-53", "version": "retrieved", "corpus_version": "v1", "knowledge_object_type": "REFERENCE_CONCEPT"}')
